  "description": "Preview, not production ready. For development and tests only: a thread-safe, in-memory implementation of AgentExperience.NET's record store, candidate source and reuse-feedback store, so the learning loop runs without PostgreSQL. Data is lost when the process ends, and none of the PostgreSQL guarantees apply (append-only enforcement, erasure reach, backups, the two database roles, crypto-shredding). Its only registration, AddAgentExperienceInMemoryStorageForDevelopment, refuses to run in a Production host environment unless explicitly overridden. Passes the same store conformance suite as the PostgreSQL adapter. Requires Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions 10.0.12 and Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting.Abstractions 10.0.3 or later within the same major.",
